  composition:{score:23,rationale:'Exact r6 Application covers one space-stage speaker, one bright plant-room speaker, two clean audio fixtures and three other measured inputs. Upper-right clock remains separated from the person and source diagrams in reviewed live-action frames; the 0.875 center is an Application adjustment, not a saved case branch. One 3:4 placement is reviewed separately as adaptation evidence, not mixed into this score.'},
